1
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:06,300
Buying a used car often starts with endless searching.

2
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:14,200
Dealers-Drive brings local dealership inventory together in one simple marketplace.

3
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:24,900
Choose your district, then narrow it down — body type, transmission, price.

4
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Every car comes with a full photo gallery, clear specifications and the dealer's own price.

5
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:46,900
And behind every car is a verified dealership you can explore — its yard, its details, its whole inventory.

6
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:57,400
Found the one? Sign in with your mobile number and your enquiry goes straight to the dealer.

7
00:00:57,400 --> 00:01:01,300
For dealerships, Dealers-Drive becomes their digital showroom.

8
00:01:01,300 --> 00:01:12,400
Sign up with a verified mobile number, add your business details and documents, and submit for verification.

9
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:21,100
Once approved, your dealership has a professional page of its own.

10
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:33,800
Add vehicles, and keep every listing accurate — reserved, sold or withdrawn, in a click.

11
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:42,900
And when a buyer like Arjun enquires, it lands in your inbox with his verified number, ready for a call.

12
00:01:43,300 --> 00:01:50,600
Dealers-Drive connects car buyers with the dealerships that serve them.

13
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:56,200
Discover. Connect. Drive.
